sequenceDiagram
  participant T as bank_test.py
  participant P as Bank process
  participant DB as SQLite
  T->>P: transfer crash, fault crash-after-debit
  P->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE and debit
  P--xP: Environment.Exit(91)
  Note over DB: the transaction was never committed
  T->>DB: checks balance intact and no operation
  T->>P: transfer lost, fault lost-response
  P->>DB: debit, credit, postings, outbox and COMMIT
  P--xT: Environment.Exit(92) without answering
  T->>P: resend with the same identity
  P-->>T: DUPLICATE_COMMITTED, no second charge
